<h4 id=3D"Notifications&amp;Alert-5.2.OSnotificationpermission">5.2. OS not=
ification permission</h4>
<p>User ph=E1=BA=A3i x=C3=A1c nh=E1=BA=ADn cho ph=C3=A9p notification permi=
ssion =C4=91=E1=BB=83 nh=E1=BA=ADn Sport Notification.</p>
<p>Khi permission b=E1=BB=8B t=E1=BA=AFt:</p>
<ul>
<li>Gi=E1=BB=AF tr=E1=BA=A1ng th=C3=A1i =C4=90=E1=BA=B7t L=E1=BB=8Bch ho=E1=
=BA=B7c Theo d=C3=B5i;</li>
<li>Kh=C3=B4ng g=E1=BB=ADi Sport Notification;</li>
<li>Kh=C3=B4ng t=E1=BB=B1 =C4=91=E1=BB=99ng unsubscribe user.</li>
</ul>
<p>Khi permission =C4=91=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3c b=E1=BA=ADt l=E1=BA=A1i:</p>
<ul>
<li>App =C4=91=E1=BB=93ng b=E1=BB=99 permission theo UC-02;</li>
<li>C=C3=A1c match c=C3=B2n eligible c=C3=B3 th=E1=BB=83 ti=E1=BA=BFp t=E1=
=BB=A5c nh=E1=BA=ADn notification m=E1=BB=9Bi.</li>
<li>Kh=C3=B4ng g=E1=BB=ADi b=C3=B9 c=C3=A1c notification trong th=E1=BB=9Di=
 gian permission b=E1=BB=8B t=E1=BA=AFt.</li>
</ul>
<p>Permission v=C3=A0 subscription l=C3=A0 hai tr=E1=BA=A1ng th=C3=A1i =C4=
=91=E1=BB=99c l=E1=BA=ADp.</p>
<p>Kh=C3=B4ng hi=E1=BB=83n th=E1=BB=8B pop-up y=C3=AAu c=E1=BA=A7u c=E1=BA=
=A5p quy=E1=BB=81n l=E1=BA=B7p =C4=91i l=E1=BA=B7p l=E1=BA=A1i li=C3=AAn t=
=E1=BB=A5c n=E1=BA=BFu ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di d=C3=B9ng =C4=91=C3=A3 th=E1=BB=
=B1c hi=E1=BB=87n thao t=C3=A1c T=E1=BB=AB ch=E1=BB=91i (Denied) ho=E1=BA=
=B7c =C4=90=E1=BB=93ng =C3=BD (Granted).</p>
<p>App kh=C3=B4ng t=E1=BB=B1 bypass Focus, Do Not Disturb ho=E1=BA=B7c noti=
fication settings c=E1=BB=A7a OS.</p>
<h4 id=3D"Notifications&amp;Alert-5.3.OSPushNotification">5.3. OS Push Noti=
fication</h4>
<p>Sport Notification =C4=91=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3c override push tr=C3=AAn notifi=
cation hi=E1=BB=87n t=E1=BA=A1i c=E1=BB=A7a app.</p>
<p>Sport Notification:</p>
<ul>
<li>Kh=C3=B4ng l=C6=B0u Sport Notification v=C3=A0o H=E1=BB=99p th=C6=B0.</=
li>
<li>B=E1=BB=8F qua Sport Notification n=E1=BA=BFu user =C4=91ang =E1=BB=9F =
trong Detail c=E1=BB=A7a ch=C3=ADnh tr=E1=BA=ADn =C4=91=C3=B3.</li>
<li>Sport Notification Types: Xem t=E1=BA=A1i 7.1. <span>Match Status Notif=
ication v=C3=A0 7.2. Match Event Notification</span></li>
